<h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-primary font-bold">Seguridad 24/7</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary-fixed mt-space-xs">Monitoreo ininterrumpido con redundancia operativa local y en la nube.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-primary-container/60 backdrop-blur-md p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-start gap-space-md">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-fixed shrink-0">
