<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary-fixed mt-space-xs">Ingreso en &lt; 2.5 seg con lectura OCR de placas, TAGs UHF y barreras veloces.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-primary-container/60 backdrop-blur-md p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-start gap-space-md">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-fixed shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">qr_code_scanner</span>
</div>
<div>
