<div class="lg:col-span-6">
<div class="bg-surface text-on-surface p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-xl">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-primary mb-space-xs">Solicitar Cotización Formal</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">Un ingeniero de proyectos HEYLEX se comunicará en menos de 2 horas hábiles.</p>
<form class="space-y-space-md" onsubmit="handleDemoSubmit(event)">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md">
<div>
<label class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Nombre Completo *</label>
<input class="w-full h-11 px-space-sm rounded bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" placeholder="Ej. Roberto Garza" required="" type="text">
</div>
<div>
<label class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Teléfono Móvil / WhatsApp *</label>
<input class="w-full h-11 px-space-sm rounded bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" placeholder="993 123 4567" required="" type="tel">
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md">
<div>
<label class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Correo Electrónico *</label>
<input class="w-full h-11 px-space-sm rounded bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" placeholder="ejemplo@comite.mx" required="" type="email">
</div>
<div>
<label class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Tipo de Desarrollo *</label>
<select class="w-full h-11 px-space-sm rounded bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary">
<option>Fraccionamiento / Residencial Privado</option>
<option>Torre de Departamentos / Condominio</option>
<option>Estacionamiento Público / Comercial</option>
<option>Parque Industrial / Corporativo</option>
<option>Otro Sector</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md">
<div>
<label class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Ciudad / Estado *</label>
<input class="w-full h-11 px-space-sm rounded bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" placeholder="Ej. Villahermosa, Tabasco" required="" type="text">
</div>
<div>
<label class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">No. de Lotes / Cajones aprox.</label>
<input class="w-full h-11 px-space-sm rounded bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" placeholder="Ej. 120 viviendas" type="text">
</div>
</div>
<div>
